      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Alprazolam, a triazolobenzodiazepine, was successfully used to treat a patient with recent cardiac disease who presented with DST-positive endogenous depression. The relative absence of cardiotoxic effects warrants the consideration of this medication in cardiac patients with concurrent anxiety and/or depression."},
